## Production Notes

- Store Solace credentials in Kubernetes secrets, AWS Secrets Manager, or your platform secret store.
- Run at least two replicas for rolling upgrades and node maintenance.
- Use a durable queue and consumer group strategy appropriate for the source topic and required delivery semantics.
- Keep AI changes scoped to the transform artifact; keep broker wiring, build, and operations files template-owned.
